@format 1
@id relay.deliver-output
@title Deliver completed output
@area Relay
@entry input
@summary Route a locally completed output to its destination tab, optionally drain source inputs, and trigger automatic downstream work.
@flow TB
@related processing.complete
@tag relay
@tag delivery

@alias courier = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LCourier
@alias list = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PList

[input] Schedule change after completion <input>
- Scan done work owned by this process for undelivered relay targets @ courier.LCourierDispatch(...)
> target

[target] Resolve delivery target <decision>
? "Finish target" > finish
? "Output exists and destination tab is available" > add
? "Output or destination is unavailable" > skipped

[finish] Finish relay chain <process>
- Record chain completion and force source removal @ courier.LCourierOutputAdd(...)
> result

[add] Add output to destination <process>
- Add the output path to the destination list with its batch cohort @ list.PListPathsAdd(...)
- Remove delivered source entries when the preference allows it @ courier.LCourierSourceRemove(...)
- Invoke automatic downstream action when enabled @ courier.LCourierArrive(...)
> result

[skipped] Delivery skipped <error>
- Record the missing output or destination @ courier.LCourierOutputAdd(...)
= The completed work remains done but is not delivered.

[result] Delivery complete <output>
= The output is delivered once and downstream cohort state is refreshed.
